        "location": "Exton, PA",
        "distanceMi": 5,
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "dealRating": "Great Price",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://assets.cai-media-management.com/ps-vehicle-media/95b2a6f7-ade6-42d8-8390-162c4f1b2218.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/788093671",
        "whyGood": "The 128i is BMW's pure-driver coupe of the E8x run \u2014 same 3.0L straight-6 as the 328i, lighter weight, shorter wheelbase. A 2013 with 85K miles for $9,000 with a Great Price badge just 5 miles away is the value highlight of this search. Same proven cloth soft-top system as the 328i.",
        "whatToVerify": "Cooling system (expansion tank, water pump, thermostat \u2014 ~100K service items); top hydraulic fluid level; trunk seal and weatherstripping; oil filter housing gasket; confirm mileage against Carfax.",
        "bottomLine": "Best value-per-mile in the dataset \u2014 a proper BMW straight-six drop-top under $10K, 5 miles away."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2009,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "CLK 350 Cabriolet",
        "price": 11470,
        "mileage": 65450,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "distanceMi": 2,
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/07/12/06/37/2009_mercedes-benz_clk-pic-5147648557516517479-1024x768.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/453249815",
        "whyGood": "W209 CLK350 is the last-gen CLK \u2014 a genuine 4-seat cabriolet with a premium interior, smooth 3.5L V6, and a fabric top that folds cleanly. 65K miles is low for a 2009. Two miles from Media makes this the easiest test drive in the search. Good Deal badge. Selden is a known local independent.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle including tonneau cover and header-rail latches; rear-window delamination; front motor-mount condition; HVAC blend-door actuators (common on this gen); balance shaft chain on M272 V6 if not already replaced.",
        "bottomLine": "Low-mileage CLK 2 miles away \u2014 closest thing to a 'found it in the neighbor's garage' buy."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2017,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Cabriolet Premium",
        "price": 13819,
        "mileage": 88594,
        "location": "Wynnewood, PA",
        "distanceMi": 10,
        "dealer": "Main Line Auto Group",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
