        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/11/04/00/2017_audi_a3-pic-2434630225716001756-1024x768.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/454248442",
        "whyGood": "Newest car in the search by a wide margin. The 8V A3 Cabriolet is a tight, modern 4-seat drop-top with MMI infotainment and the reliable EA888 2.0T. 10 miles away in Wynnewood. Good Deal pricing for a 2017 with under 90K miles. AWD quattro adds all-weather capability rare in a convertible.",
        "whatToVerify": "DSG fluid service history; soft-top rear-window yellowing (common on early 8V builds); rear-seat headroom for intended passengers; side-mirror fold function; any CPO or extended-warranty coverage remaining.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern and feature-rich convertible in the dataset \u2014 best choice if daily-driver comfort matters."
      },
