        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/dabcb463-e945-41fc-b07c-dd08637d350a/",
        "whyGood": "Supercharged 3.0T V6 in an S5 Cabriolet is the performance wild card of this search \u2014 333hp, quattro AWD, and the premium B8 interior. 69K miles is moderate. Clean-title/no-accidents filter on Cars.com provides extra confidence. Harder to find than the A5 and well worth the slight premium.",
        "whatToVerify": "Supercharger belt and tensioner condition; oil separator/PCV system (known wear item on 3.0T); top mechanism fluid and pump; rear-quarter window seals; quattro rear diff fluid.",
        "bottomLine": "The horsepower bargain of the bunch \u2014 supercharged V6 AWD drop-top under $14K."
      },
      {
