        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/b676f2a7-3adb-4354-a70a-41524da305fd/",
        "whyGood": "Only 44K original miles on an E64 650i convertible \u2014 lowest-mileage car in the dataset. V8 power, retractable hardtop, and the drama of an M Sport-era BMW grand tourer for under $13K. Private seller means no dealer markup but requires extra due diligence.",
        "whatToVerify": "N62 V8 valve stem seals (blue smoke on cold start = warning); ZF 6HP auto fluid; CCC iDrive unit function; top mechanism (E64 hardtop is complex \u2014 verify full open/close cycle, check for wind noise); coolant pipe condition (under-intake pipes crack).",
