        "whyGood": "F33 435i is a generation newer than the 328i \u2014 TwinPower turbo I6, 8-speed ZF auto, modern iDrive, and xDrive AWD. At $8,500 with a Great Price badge it's aggressively priced. 140K is on the high side but the N55 engine is known to go well past 200K with routine maintenance.",
